  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Local Humanitarian Leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Enter into agreement with Women Organisation (WO(s) 2. Consultations/listening sessions with WOs and women leaders, planning, and implementation  3. Nation level convening with women leaders in Disaster Risk Reduction (DRR) and Humanitarian actions 4. Produce case study on women in local humanitarian leadership 5. Enable platform for convening with women leaders (women in all their diversities), community and government leaders and DRR practitioners in the country and at the regional level</narrative>
  </description>
